{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/aa6d8cc0dc01c42bf5c5279b99a91d89.poster.avif?t=1764270332\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/aa6d8cc0dc01c42bf5c5279b99a91d89.webm?t=1764270332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/aa6d8cc0dc01c42bf5c5279b99a91d89.mp4?t=1764270332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Forget. Everything. And. Run. FEAR the Huntsman</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience  one of humanity's most primal fears in Huntsman, a survival horror that will immerse you in the creeping dread and crawling terror\u00a0of arachnophobia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/9691e223865bb4f7092b2ffd7643d610.poster.avif?t=1764270332\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/9691e223865bb4f7092b2ffd7643d610.webm?t=1764270332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/9691e223865bb4f7092b2ffd7643d610.mp4?t=1764270332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the new security guard at Atherton Laboratories, chaos erupts as\u00a0eight-legged predators infest the hallways. Outnumbered and defenseless, you must find a way to eliminate the threats and lift the facility lockdown to escape. Will you survive, or become the spider's next prey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend into the Web -\u00a0</strong>Explore a facility overrun by invasive predators. Divert limited power between sections of the building to access new areas, gather vital resources, and outmaneuver the swarm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improvise or Die</strong> -\u00a0Use your flashlight, throwables, and the environment itself to distract, mislead, and evade the deadliest creatures you've ever faced. Just remember: one wrong move, and you're prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fear Has Eight Legs -\u00a0</strong>Experience arachnophobia like never before! Each spider moves, hunts, and reacts with terrifying realism triggering primal instincts your mind won\u2019t be able to ignore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/6c6c70eb153561a5ea5e2eeb934da616.poster.avif?t=1764270332\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/6c6c70eb153561a5ea5e2eeb934da616.webm?t=1764270332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/extras/6c6c70eb153561a5ea5e2eeb934da616.mp4?t=1764270332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"An Arachnoid Presence ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814680/33d5fa2767c2b7ce4bab8648091ee0afa882de83.jpg"},{"name":"Let There Be Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814680/096abc1da9c1f7252427da0bcd106302e1d36778.jpg"},{"name":"Run Forest, Ruuuuun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814680/5c6df6c1e7d93ac0762bb4c830dc050e3d4c706f.jpg"},{"name":"The Noxious Avenger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814680/83c0de5b70f39309c78f135d04d08f23d2346ad2.jpg"},{"name":"Clocked Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814680/2fd0ab01d7c4f9b920901d77fe2a6e6797d50946.jpg"},{"name":"Butter Fingers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814680/fd1d6812fc6d233238be9174662e7626bc57aa67.jpg"},{"name":"Get Yeeted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814680/fc79d3b71355a74c9ee368d884e3543f1176c807.jpg"},{"name":"Tied Up At The Moment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814680/e3083b4ec08f977a2b1cf2e24cf0576ae028bf1c.jpg"},{"name":"Don't Skip Leg Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814680/f1937b836a345f393085c64228e071370f5f981c.jpg"},{"name":"Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814680/b5eb1fee266d23b847858f6e71fab1f0b8a811ad.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814680?t=1764270332","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/917184cda6bb64afdf68a25cdbd4fd9fdef4ab80/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764270332","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/d1ac09b6ab84780aeea966383b34191b093f805d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764270332","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814680/d1ac09b6ab84780aeea966383b34191b093f805d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764270332","categories":[{"d